{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        126.61820220947266,
        27.289522171020508,
        326.90234375,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "5. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE NEWBORN CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.1029052734375,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "between the intervention and control groups. One study reported that a combination",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.07275390625,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "of ceftazidime plus ampicillin had higher cure rates than the ampicillin-gentamicin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        112.89290618896484,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "combination.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        110.26070404052734,
        163.95286560058594,
        122.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "5.5.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        125.9054183959961,
        88.77290344238281,
        138.04542541503906
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.91542053222656,
        399.082763671875,
        152.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "Available evidence indicates no difference in cure rates and mortality between 3rd",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.91542053222656,
        399.07293701171875,
        165.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "generation cephalosporin monotherapy and penicillin-aminoglycoside combination",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.91539001464844,
        399.14276123046875,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "therapy. However, effects may vary in different settings depending on antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.91539001464844,
        399.08294677734375,
        191.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "susceptibility patterns. Other benefits of 3rd generation cephalosporins are good",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.91539001464844,
        380.4228820800781,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "cerebrospinal fluid penetration and convenient once/twice daily administration.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        212.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        224.54930114746094
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        225.41929626464844,
        399.1027526855469,
        238.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "The risks of ceftriaxone include displacement of bilirubin from albumin leading",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        238.41929626464844,
        399.1029052734375,
        251.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "to higher free bilirubin and risk of kernicterus and promotion of beta-lactamase",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        251.41929626464844,
        99.02289581298828,
        264.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "resistance.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        275.9378967285156,
        205.30300903320312,
        287.9278869628906
      ],
      "text": "5.5.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        291.5924987792969,
        399.0928039550781,
        305.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "Neonates with suspected sepsis will require admission irrespective of the antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        304.5924987792969,
        399.1228942871094,
        318.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "chosen. Therefore differences in the convenience of administration are less",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        317.5924987792969,
        396.7826843261719,
        331.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "important. Median price of ampicillin (250 mg) is US$ 0.18/vial, gentamicin (10mg/",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        330.5924987792969,
        399.11279296875,
        344.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "ml) is US$  0.07/ml, and ceftriaxone (250 mg) is US$ 0.44/vial. Cefotaxime is more",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        343.5924987792969,
        167.46292114257812,
        357.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "expensive than ceftriaxone.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.1401062011719,
        390.2569580078125,
        380.3291015625
      ],
      "text": "5.6\t Head or whole body cooling in management of hypoxic ischaemic",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        380.1401062011719,
        162.51669311523438,
        393.3291015625
      ],
      "text": "encephalopathy",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        396.7657775878906,
        399.0827941894531,
        410.25579833984375
      ],
      "text": "Head or whole body cooling should not be done outside well-resourced, tertiary",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        409.7657775878906,
        399.14276123046875,
        423.25579833984375
      ],
      "text": "neonatal intensive care units, because there is potential for harm from this therapy",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        422.76580810546875,
        155.32289123535156,
        436.2558288574219
      ],
      "text": "in low-resource settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        438.17041015625,
        277.7628173828125,
        452.0904235839844
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        454.43499755859375,
        399.1029052734375,
        467.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "The panel made this recommendation on the basis of potential harm from",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        467.43499755859375,
        399.0829772949219,
        480.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "body cooling if applied outside a neonatal intensive care unit where mechanical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        480.43499755859375,
        399.0829162597656,
        493.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "ventilation, sedation and other supportive care cannot safely be provided. It noted",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        493.43499755859375,
        399.0427551269531,
        506.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "that in low resource settings there was no evidence supporting this therapy and that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        506.43499755859375,
        399.06298828125,
        519.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "it was expensive. However, in well resourced tertiary neonatal intensive care units,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        519.4349975585938,
        399.15289306640625,
        532.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "treatment with whole body cooling as part of high quality intensive care support",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        532.4349975585938,
        399.0828857421875,
        545.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "improves survival and reduces disability for term neonates with asphyxia and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        545.4349975585938,
        186.3129119873047,
        558.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "hypoxic ischaemic encephalopy.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        569.9535522460938,
        231.48292541503906,
        581.943603515625
      ],
      "text": "5.6.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        585.6082763671875,
        399.0628356933594,
        599.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "There is moderate quality evidence that induced hypothermia (cooling) of newborn",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        598.6082763671875,
        399.08270263671875,
        612.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "babies who may have suffered from a lack of oxygen at birth reduces death or",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        611.6082763671875,
        399.0728759765625,
        625.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "disability, without increasing disability in survivors. The damage caused by the lack",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.4055938720703,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.64059448242188,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "29",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}